From d5a83fa3802fe446c643f2acf16b16b6600d037b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nathan Singh <nathan.singh@hotmail.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 14:51:23 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] Arena: the messages for the arena's menus

Adds the MsgArena* messages to text/en.po (prompts, labels, stat and shop
lines, the victory line), so the menus draw in the game's own font. English
only; the other editions do not build. New messages go at the end, because keys
must be contiguous from 0. Nothing uses them yet.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 games/tbs/text/en.po | 186 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 186 insertions(+)

